  const free=completionPlan({...state,cap:Infinity},team,{white});
  if(!free.possible)return free;
  return free.minimumCost>plan.minimumCost+1e-9?{possible:false,minimumCost:free.minimumCost,reason:`Минимальный бюджет полного состава с игроком «белого правила» ${free.minimumCost.toFixed(2)} превышает лимит ${state.cap}`}:plan;
 }

The recursion ends at once, because with cap:Infinity the core cannot fail on the cap. The extra cost is one uncapped white search, and only on refusals.

